            "content": "<ul><li><strong>S</strong> — Chest 36-38 in, Length 27 in</li><li><strong>M</strong> — Chest 39-41 in, Length 28 in</li><li><strong>L</strong> — Chest 42-44 in, Length 29 in</li><li><strong>XL</strong> — Chest 45-47 in, Length 30 in</li><li><strong>2XL</strong> — Chest 48-50 in, Length 31 in</li><li><strong>3XL</strong> — Chest 51-53 in, Length 32 in</li><li><strong>4XL</strong> — Chest 54-56 in, Length 33 in</li></ul><p>If between sizes, size up. Measurements are of the garment, not body.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_tab": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
            "icon": "chat_bubble",
            "content": "<p><strong>Does it shrink?</strong><br/>Pre-shrunk fabric, minimal shrinkage. Wash cold, air dry for best results.</p><p><strong>Is it true to size?</strong><br/>Yes — relaxed unisex fit. Size up if between sizes.</p><p><strong>What is the fabric weight?</strong><br/>6.5 oz heavyweight cotton.</p><p><strong>Can I return or exchange?</strong><br/>Yes, within 30 days of delivery, unworn condition.</p>"
          }
        },
        "share": {
          "type": "share",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "share_label": "Share"
